cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "realistic-test-data: consistent synthetic test data in six formats"
message: "If you use this data in published work, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Castillejos
    given-names: Jason
    alias: jasocami
repository-code: "https://github.com/jasocami/realistic-test-data"
url: "https://github.com/jasocami/realistic-test-data"
abstract: >-
  Fully synthetic, internally consistent test data across five topics
  (clinical, supermarket, finance, automobile and education), published in
  CSV, JSON, SQLite, PDF, PNG and JPEG. Every foreign key resolves, the same
  records appear in every format, monetary totals reconcile to the cent, and
  identifiers carry valid check digits. Generated deterministically from
  seeded generators included in the repository.
keywords:
  - synthetic-data
  - test-data
  - test-fixtures
  - sample-data
  - mock-data
  - csv
  - json
  - sqlite
  - open-data
